  "qualification_limits": [
    "Intel SEP and 48-bit native host; declared 57-bit processor/paging cases have portable source qualification only.",
    "X87 and sixteen XMM registers have explicit noninitial native seeds. Full ZMM/AMX, larger XSAVE2 snapshots and other CPUs are not qualified.",
    "Compatibility entry, legacy modes, TF/RF/IOPL/VIF/VIP expansion, faults, CET/FRED, asynchronous events and SMM restoration remain outside V7.",
    "The continuation has explicit state and stop codes; an opaque SYSENTER lift is not an ordinary C ABI or full native rewritten-register context.",
    "Public SDK/CLI export uses linked ELF fixtures; this phase does not add independent PE/COFF or Mach-O V7 qualification.",
    "NeverC stage-1 plus exported C/IR checks are qualified; full product CI, stage-2 and global instruction completion are not claimed."
  ],
  "release_and_pins_changed": false
